# Paths whose changes need the complete verify at every stop, not just the quick tier: things
# that change how the whole project builds or runs, where a scoped check can't see the effect.
# One bash glob per line, relative to the repo root (the workspace root in workspace mode).
# * matches across folders. Adjust to this project's layout.

package.json
*/package.json
*lock.json
*.lock
*lock.yaml
*.config.*
*/tsconfig*.json
tsconfig*.json
Dockerfile*
*/Dockerfile*
Makefile
*.toml
go.mod
go.sum
.github/workflows/*
bin/verify
